<h3>二、Violations Identified</h3>

<p><b>Violation 1 — Misleading Performance Claims (Section 3.2)</b></p>
<p>Your listing states "<i>Blocks 99.7% of phishing emails with zero false positives</i>" — the buyer complaint included evidence that 3.2% of phishing emails were not blocked. AWS requires verifiable claims backed by independent testing.</p>

<p><b>Violation 2 — Improper Data Collection Disclosure (Section 5.1)</b></p>
<p>Your product processes buyer email data but your listing does not include AWS's required Data Processing Agreement (DPA) addendum, which must specify data residency, retention, and subprocessor details.</p>

<p><b>Violation 3 — Competitive Comparison Without Substantiation (Section 3.7)</b></p>
<p>Your listing includes a comparison chart showing Vigilyx outperforming "leading competitors" without citing independent benchmark sources.</p>

